{"seq":17,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-06-phl-tickets/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:51:14.981Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"be344fbe5643677c61b6bbdf883caa8352fd0df6c055af301da579b6b4424888","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Bettina, here's the list for Kwame's account review. It comes from #coastal-team, #coastal-random and Moss's Coastal digests and cheat sheet. I also checked your public Pellucid cutover recap note.\n\n**Pellucid Harbor Logistics (PHL, Gulf Coast)**\n- **#4419:** The `Yard_Dwell_Summary` report times out when filtered by container length. It is still open. Source: Moss's Coastal cheat sheet.\n- **#PD-8841:** The chassis pool hold on double-booked gates, seen at Gate 4B. Source: your 2025-12-08 cutover recap.\n- Chassis pool validation at Gate 4 during shift change is listed as the main friction point. I found no ticket number for it.\n\n**Driftmoor Marine Freight (DMF, Puget Sound)**\n- **Feature request #882:** A bulk-clear button for departed barges, requested by their warehouse managers. Source: Moss's Coastal cheat sheet.\n- **#4419 (as logged in Moss's 11/2 digest):** Barge slip 7 schedule sync. DMF asked for a patched manifest CSV before the 06:00 shift.\n- The tide-table import macro failed on Terminal B, and engineering gave the night dispatcher a manual CSV patch. I found no ticket number for it.\n\n**Check before the review:** #4419 is attached to PHL in the cheat sheet and to DMF in the 11/2 digest. I can't tell from the notes which account it belongs to. Kwame will need to confirm it, or one of the two numbers is a typo.\n\n**Left out**\n- Pellow Home Living (formerly Covey & Lark Retail): #8812 and PD-4821.\n- Saltmarsh Provisions: PD-4827 and PD-4824.\n\nNothing in #coastal-team or #coastal-random mentions either account directly, so everything above comes from the notes. I only used the channels you're in and public files."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
